; Hot Pursuit: made by Voxcade's composer (tools/compose.py in Voxcade's source)
; from its recipe music/hot_pursuit.compose.toml (action, A minor, 144 bpm,
; seed 5). Neither comes with a game: change the song here, by hand.
; Chords from free-midi-chords by Ludovic Drolez (MIT).
;
; A: VI VII v III (minor): F G Em C
; B: i VII III VI (minor): Am G C F
; Form, 8 bars each: intro A | theme A | theme A | bridge B | bridge B | break A | theme A | bridge B | theme A | turn B
; Variation: most (every fourth bar walks and pushes, the broken chords turn, ghost notes on the hi-hat, later themes answer backwards).

#title Hot Pursuit
#tempo 144

